body: "Read-only discovery during SDK package/settings delivery. createAssuranceWorkspaceContext strict mode calls runList with full/noTruncate/strictRead but no includeBody. evaluateMeasurement prose_edge_gap inspects bodies when available. Controlled public SDK proof used two real items outside checkout ancestors with isolated project/global roots; only its own temporary workspace was removed. The issue remains open/unclaimed; no assurance code, exemptions, budgets or thresholds are changed in this delivery."
